  "description": "Elm-inspired encoder and decoder for JSON, this package is the core library which can be used on any F# project.\n\nPick the right additional package for your runtime:\n\n- Thoth.Json.JavaScript\n- Thoth.Json.Python\n- Thoth.Json.Newtonsoft\n- Thoth.Json.System.Text.Json",
