  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "### 🚀 Features\n\n* Adds codecs (#247) ([d7322a4](https://github.com/thoth-org/Thoth.Json/commit/d7322a4c40cd20bd3660e60696bd3e7024f8a972))\n* Add support for System.Uri ([a3d578e](https://github.com/thoth-org/Thoth.Json/commit/a3d578ed7af595b9f302da985f361cb25e4c3d4a))\n* Add Encode.mapList/mapArray/mapSeq/mapResizeArray helpers ([9b26aa6](https://github.com/thoth-org/Thoth.Json/commit/9b26aa6200ebaa4dbe17e8ec78fb292a1a4f61ca))\n* Add `Decode.requireSome` and `Decode.notNone` (#253) ([29e05cc](https://github.com/thoth-org/Thoth.Json/commit/29e05cc77804e2ad4ce13d75a73c60c6fcf4ab36))\n* Make nan and infinity round-trip ([c52c092](https://github.com/thoth-org/Thoth.Json/commit/c52c092b571710995992683c88ae21f583658bca))\n* Tuple union case encoding (#262) ([e90f526](https://github.com/thoth-org/Thoth.Json/commit/e90f5268764ec4bd0fc5c2ce594bdfa2f50353ff))\n* Support DateTime and DateTimeOffset decoders under Python ([a50bf27](https://github.com/thoth-org/Thoth.Json/commit/a50bf272d3b372ecd2492d7873259e6d3382762b))\n\n### 🐞 Bug Fixes\n\n* Handle int64 and uint64 outside of float precision (#244) ([feb96ac](https://github.com/thoth-org/Thoth.Json/commit/feb96ac397da85eed4555888ae88a169af4308a6))\n* Support very large floats (#263) ([7ebb319](https://github.com/thoth-org/Thoth.Json/commit/7ebb3193ca6cb929857f454a8369aedb564f00bc))\n\n<strong><small>[View changes on Github](https://github.com/thoth-org/Thoth.Json/compare/7e3cf6576d8ebb5e7655e18dc8ae97ad136cee9b..581fd36fef81aaae62cdde3bf4821d2dcbc98558)</small></strong>\n\n## Unreleased\n\n### Added\n\n* Codec support",
